  "description": "Transport-independent idempotency core: a record store contract with token-fenced reservations and\n      opaque byte payloads, in-memory and IDistributedCache stores, claim-based scope resolvers, deterministic\n      idempotency keys (canonical, hashed and UUIDv5), and an executor and message inbox that run an operation at most\n      once.",
